<title>USA: Bouygues Offshore IPO priced at $12-3/8/ADS.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Offshore IPO priced at $12-3/8/ADS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bouygues Offshore SA said on Thursday its global initial public offering of 6.8 million shares was priced at $12-3/8 per American Depositary Share (ADS), or FF 127 per share.</p>
<p>Each ADS represents one-half of one share.  The ADSs are expected to begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The estimated price range on the IPO was $10.75 to $12.75 per ADS.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers is global coordinator of the offering.</p>
</text>
